        "read": false,
        "user_title": "",
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Also it's 20% off!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Edit:</strong>&nbsp;Well, I bought it and started playing it.&nbsp; I can't recommend it.&nbsp; The controls literally do not register a significant percentage of the time.&nbsp; The camera rotates backward from the way I expect and \"Invert X Axis\" on the settings screen has no effect.&nbsp; The font is absolutely microscopic on the Switch portable screen.&nbsp; And it takes so long to load I thought it had crashed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hopefully a patch will be incoming shortly....</p>",
